ched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3771907C8965B28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1710364021:1":{"text":"そうね。みんなはここで少し休んでて。ロワン、あんたは私について来て！","source_cn":"亨德里克卿言之有理。大家先原地休息一刻钟。罗万，跟我来这边！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCFEA6CFF5B4D3190","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1710364022:1":{"text":"では、私はもう一度マーリン様と連絡を取ってみますね。今度こそつながるといいのですが……","source_cn":"那我也再试着联络一下梅林大人吧，希望这次能联络上……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x67CFC97B9130BD73","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"では、私はもう一度マーリン様と連絡を取ってみますね。今度こそつながるといいのですが……","female":"では、私はもう一度マーリン様と連絡を取ってみますね。今度こそつながるといいのですが……","variant_male_record_index":"226083","variant_female_record_index":"226084","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:29::0":{"text":"魔法通信機","source_cn":"魔法通讯器","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x947F19C1A7611A38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1710364023:0":{"text":"カスティーは隅の方へ移動し、通信機を取り出して、もう一度魔力を込めてみた。","source_cn":"科丝蒂拿着通讯器走向一旁，对着其再次注入魔力。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9F9AA5DF4499130","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1710364024:0":{"text":"すると、驚いたことに、通信機が反応を見せたのだ。","source_cn":"